msgid "Aggressive"
msgstr "አጥቂ"

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:62
msgid "Everything in Advanced, Plus"
msgstr "በAdvanced እና Plus ውስጥ ያሉት ሁሉም ነገሮች"

